{"legend":"<h2 id=\"условие-задачи\">Условие задачи</h2> \n<p><strong>Правильный ответ в этой задаче дает 10 баллов.</strong></p> \n<p>Существует редкое заболевание, которым болеет <strong>1%</strong> населения.</p> \n<p>Для диагностики этого заболевания разработан новый тест, который работает следующим образом:</p> \n<ul> \n <li><p>Если человек <strong>действительно болен</strong>, тест покажет положительный результат в <strong>99%</strong> случаев.</p></li> \n <li><p>Если человек <strong>здоров</strong>, тест покажет отрицательный результат в <strong>98%</strong> случаев.</p></li> \n</ul> \n<h2 id=\"теория\">Теория</h2> \n<p><strong>Вероятность</strong></p> \n<p><em>Интуитивно</em> Вероятность — это число от 0 до 1, показывающее, насколько «ожидаемо» событие:<br> 0 — невозможно, 1 — случится обязательно, середина — «может быть» с тем или иным шансом.</p> \n<p><em>Формально</em> Вероятность события <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> — это значение вероятностной меры <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        P\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        (\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        )\n       </mo>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       P(A)\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> (функция, которая событиям приписывает число от 0 до 1), причём: <span class=\"math display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n     <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\n      <semantics>\n       <mrow>\n        <mn>\n         0\n        </mn>\n        <mo>\n         ≤\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         A\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         ≤\n        </mo>\n        <mn>\n         1\n        </mn>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n        <mspace width=\"1em\" />\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n         Ω\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mn>\n         1\n        </mn>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n        <mspace width=\"1em\" />\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n         ∅\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mn>\n         0\n        </mn>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n       </mrow>\n       <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n        0 \\leq P(A) \\leq 1,\\quad P(\\Omega)=1,\\quad P(\\varnothing)=0,\n       </annotation>\n      </semantics>\n     </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span> где <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n        Ω\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       \\Omega\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> — всё возможное, <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n        ∅\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       \\varnothing\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span> — невозможное событие. При равновозможных исходах: <span class=\"math display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n     <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\n      <semantics>\n       <mrow>\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         A\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mfrac>\n         <mtext>\n          число&nbsp;благоприятных&nbsp;исходов\n         </mtext>\n         <mtext>\n          общее&nbsp;число&nbsp;исходов\n         </mtext>\n        </mfrac>\n        <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n         .\n        </mi>\n       </mrow>\n       <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n        P(A) = \\frac{\\text{число благоприятных исходов}}{\\text{общее число исходов}}.\n       </annotation>\n      </semantics>\n     </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">общее</span><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">число</span><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">исходов</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">число</span><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">благоприятных</span><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">исходов</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n<p><em>Применение</em></p> \n<ul> \n <li><p>Data analysis: доля пользователей, совершивших покупку, интерпретируется как оценка <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          покупка\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{покупка})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">покупка</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n <li><p>ML: выход модели-классификатора (например, 0.83) трактуется как оценка <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          класс\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mn>\n          1\n         </mn>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          признаки\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{класс}=1 \\mid \\text{признаки})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">класс</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">признаки</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n</ul> \n<p><strong>Условная вероятность</strong></p> \n<p><em>Интуитивно</em> Это «вероятность внутри фильтра»: уже известно, что произошло <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>, и интересует шанс <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> среди таких случаев, а не среди всех.</p> \n<p><em>Официально</em> Условная вероятность <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> при <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> определяется как: <span class=\"math display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n     <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\n      <semantics>\n       <mrow>\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         A\n        </mi>\n        <mo>\n         ∣\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         B\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mfrac>\n         <mrow>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           A\n          </mi>\n          <mo>\n           ∩\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           B\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n         </mrow>\n         <mrow>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           B\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n         </mrow>\n        </mfrac>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n        <mspace width=\"1em\" />\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         B\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         &gt;\n        </mo>\n        <mn>\n         0\n        </mn>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n       </mrow>\n       <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n        P(A \\mid B) = \\frac{P(A \\cap B)}{P(B)}, \\quad P(B) &gt; 0,\n       </annotation>\n      </semantics>\n     </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span> где <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo>\n        ∩\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A \\cap B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> — «оба события одновременно».</p> \n<p><em>Применение</em></p> \n<ul> \n <li><p>Data analysis: конверсия сегмента <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          конверсия\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          канал\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          соцсети\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         = P(\\text{конверсия} \\mid \\text{канал}=\\text{соцсети})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">конверсия</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">канал</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">соцсети</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n <li><p>ML: чувствительность по классу <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          k\n         </mi>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          верный&nbsp;прогноз\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          класс\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          k\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         k = P(\\text{верный прогноз} \\mid \\text{класс}=k)\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">верный</span><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">прогноз</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">класс</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n</ul> \n<p><strong>Теорема Байеса</strong></p> \n<p><em>Интуитивно</em> Помогает «перевернуть» условную вероятность: из «насколько часто <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> случается, если верна причина <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>» получить «насколько вероятна причина <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>, когда увидели <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>», с учётом стартовой уверенности (априори).</p> \n<p><em>Официально</em> Формула Байеса: <span class=\"math display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n     <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\n      <semantics>\n       <mrow>\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         A\n        </mi>\n        <mo>\n         ∣\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         B\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mfrac>\n         <mrow>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           B\n          </mi>\n          <mo>\n           ∣\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           A\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n          <mo>\n           ⋅\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           A\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n         </mrow>\n         <mrow>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           B\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n         </mrow>\n        </mfrac>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n       </mrow>\n       <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n        P(A \\mid B) = \\frac{P(B \\mid A) \\cdot P(A)}{P(B)},\n       </annotation>\n      </semantics>\n     </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span> где <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        P\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        (\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        )\n       </mo>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       P(A)\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — априорная вероятность (стартовая оценка <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>), <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        P\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        (\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n       <mo>\n        ∣\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        )\n       </mo>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       P(B \\mid A)\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — правдоподобие (насколько типично <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> при <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>), <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        P\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        (\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo>\n        ∣\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        )\n       </mo>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       P(A \\mid B)\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — апостериорная вероятность (обновлённая оценка <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> после факта <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>).</p> \n<p><em>Применение</em></p> \n<ul> \n <li><p>Data analysis: корректная интерпретация положительного теста при редком событии (учёт базовой распространённости <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          A\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(A)\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>).</p></li> \n <li><p>ML: наивный Байес — вычисление <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          класс\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          признаки\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{класс} \\mid \\text{признаки})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">класс</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">признаки</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> через <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          признаки\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          класс\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n         <mo>\n          ⋅\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          класс\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{признаки} \\mid \\text{класс}) \\cdot P(\\text{класс})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">признаки</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">класс</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">класс</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> и нормировку по <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          признаки\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{признаки})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cyrillic_fallback\">признаки</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n</ul> \n<h2 id=\"формат-ответа\">Формат ответа</h2> \n<p>Случайно выбранный человек из населения сдал тест, и его результат оказался <strong>положительным</strong>.</p> \n<p>Какова вероятность того, что этот человек <strong>действительно болен</strong>? Ответ округлите до четырех знаков после запятой.</p> \n<p>Ответ нужно представить в виде десятичной дроби с четырьмя знаками после точки, например, 0.3147.</p>","interaction":null,"inputFormat":null,"outputFormat":null,"notes":null,"scoring":null}